* ''Open faces, one worn'' (house reading of the lit set, 2026-11-11, under the operator's rulings above). A vessel keeps several faces OPEN, each sealing under its own key, and wears ONE; the AI seat marks its calls `"seat": "ai"` and acts as the worn face alone, refusing `face-hand-refused` where a call names another (`seat-hand.ts`). Landed (`029d87df8`).

